#. de: Portion[p] Kristallpaste
#. fr: morceau de pâte de cristal
#. column 2: pinches of crystal paste
#. column 8: Clay containing a specific proportion of pulverized crystal. According to master weaponsmith Gerolt, this substance helps improve the bond between voidsent and their worldly vessels.
